U-Boot loader and related files for the Banana Pi BPI-R3, for booting
from the onboard eMMC (SW1 set to eMMC boot).

The boot ROM loads bl2.img from the eMMC boot0 hardware partition. BL2
then loads u-boot.fip, which holds BL31 and U-Boot, from the GPT
partition named "fip" in the eMMC user area. U-Boot keeps its
environment in the GPT partition named "ubootenv".
